<title>GREECE: Bank of Crete extends tender deadline to Jan 10.</title>
<headline>Bank of Crete extends tender deadline to Jan 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Crete has extended the deadline for tenders for its privatisation to January 10 from December 16 after pressure from interested parties, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;This move was necessary after requests by certain investors, who wrote to the bank that they were unable to meet the deadlines for the three-year business plan demanded by bidding conditions,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>No other deadlines or bidding terms will change, it added.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
